    },
    "ModuleConfig": {
      "description": "One Objektplan module — drives BOTH the app's plan tile and the import parsing, so a\nstation configures its module set / labels / parsing in one place.\n\nDisplay: ``code`` is the short tile label ('M1', '2/3', 'Wasser'), plus title/subtitle/\norientation/order/icon. Parsing: ``match`` is a regex tested (case-insensitive) against a\nsource PDF's filename stem — the first module whose ``match`` hits claims the file.\n``combinedWith`` marks a combined sheet that also fills other slots (modul2-3 → modul2 +\nmodul3). ``family`` marks a generative module whose ``match`` has a capture group for a\nsub-slot — \"Modul 5 - Wasser\" → ``modul5-wasser`` labelled \"Wasser\".",
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "title": "Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "code": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Code"
        },
        "title": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Title"
        },
        "subtitle": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Subtitle"
        },
        "orientation": {
          "default": "landscape",
          "enum": [
            "portrait",
            "landscape"
          ],
          "title": "Orientation",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "order": {
          "default": 0,
          "title": "Order",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "icon": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Icon"
        },
        "match": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Match"
        },
        "combinedWith": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Combinedwith"
        },
        "family": {
          "default": false,
          "title": "Family",
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "viewer": {
          "default": false,
          "title": "Viewer",
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "id"
      ],
      "title": "ModuleConfig",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "RankConfig": {
      "description": "One Dienstgrad in the station's ordered rank list. Position in ``roster.ranks`` is\nthe seniority order (most senior first). ``tier`` drives the \"nur Offiziere\" picker\nfilter and the Anwesenheit grouping; ``abbr`` is the short badge shown in lists.",
